83
00:07:42.349 --> 00:07:49.740
Verification provides evidence that selected
practices and controls were performed.

84
00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:56.922
Consider this worked case: An organization
uses a checklist to audit its database

85
00:07:56.922 --> 00:08:02.998
architecture, confirming that encryption is
applied, access controls are enforced, and

86
00:08:02.998 --> 00:08:05.208
